Package: roze
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), gcc | clang
Suggests: default-jdk
Maintainer: Firoze <firoze@roze-lang.org>
Description: The Roze Programming Language Toolchain
 Roze is an expressive, fast, statically typed systems programming
 language supporting dual native Cranelift/C code generation and JVM
 execution, automatic reference counting, safe concurrency, and bare-metal
 freestanding kernel capabilities.
 Homepage: https://roze-lang.org
